\ ==== print-gauges ( -- ) ====

\ The moving readings of gauges as a six-row table. Every number depends on the
\ machine and the moment, so the runner's .sed replaces each with N; what the golden
\ pins is the rows, labels, units, and columns.

print-gauges

\ -- a second call after work: the same layout, with rates against the first sample
10000 iota [: dup * :] map drop
print-gauges
